        "original_id": "53a0b155-4e4d-5ab3-b456-3ef6f2391cc4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yeshashework Yilma, Haile Selassie I, Yilma Makonnen\n- Places: Ethiopia, Harar\n- Roles: Princess, Dejazmatch, governor, regent, emperor\n\nFacts:\n- Haile Selassie I was born Tafari Makonnen Woldemikael on 23 July 1892.\n- Haile Selassie I was Ethiopia's regent from 1916 to 1930.\n- Haile Selassie I was emperor of Ethiopia from 1930 to 1974.\n- Haile Selassie I died on 27 August 1975.\n- Princess Yeshashework Yilma was the daughter of Dejazmatch Yilma Makonnen.\n- Yilma Makonnen was governor of Harar.\n- Princess Yeshashework Yilma was the niece of Emperor Haile Selassie of Ethiopia.\n- Princess Yeshashework Yilma died in 1982.",
